extends base

block content

	main

		section.privacyPolicyPage
			.container

				.privacyPolicyPage--box

					.privacyPolicyPage--heading-box

						h1.privacyPolicyPage--heading Privacy Policy
						
						.privacyPolicyPage--sub-heading--box
						
							p.privacyPolicyPage__tagline How Ang Hiyas collects, uses and protects your personal information

							p.privacyPolicyPage__updated Last updated: 24 July 2026

						.privacyPolicyPage--text-box
							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Ang Hiyas respects your privacy and is committed to handling personal information responsibly. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect through our website, why we collect it, how it may be used or shared, and the choices available to you.


					.privacyPolicyPage__content

						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Information we collect

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Depending on how you use our website and services, we may collect:

							ul.privacyPolicyPage__list

								li Your name, email address and phone number

								li Delivery and billing addresses

								li Account information, including a securely hashed password

								li Order, rental, wishlist and shopping-cart information

								li Custom tailoring details, garment preferences and measurements you provide

								li Enquiries, messages and other communications with Ang Hiyas

								li Browser, device, IP address, cookie and website-usage information

								li Limited payment information returned by our payment providers, such as transaction identifiers, payment status, amount paid and payment method


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Payment information

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Online payments are processed securely by third-party payment providers, including Stripe, Afterpay and PayPal.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Ang Hiyas does not receive or store complete credit card numbers, debit card numbers, CVVs or payment-account credentials. We may receive limited information needed to confirm a payment, process a refund, investigate a failed payment or resolve a payment dispute.


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading How we use your information

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We may use personal information to:

							ul.privacyPolicyPage__list

								li Create and manage customer accounts

								li Process and manage purchases, rentals, refunds and returns

								li Provide custom tailoring and alteration services

								li Arrange delivery, collection, fittings and rental returns

								li Respond to enquiries and customer-service requests

								li Send order confirmations, account notifications and other service-related emails

								li Prevent fraud, misuse and unauthorised access

								li Maintain business, accounting and transaction records

								li Monitor and improve the performance and usability of our website


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Sharing your information

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We do not sell or rent your personal information.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We may share information with trusted service providers where reasonably necessary to operate our website and provide our services, including:

							ul.privacyPolicyPage__list

								li Stripe, Afterpay and PayPal for payment processing

								li Courier, postal and delivery providers

								li Website hosting and database providers

								li Email and customer-communication providers

								li Website analytics and security providers

								li Professional advisers, insurers or government authorities where required by law


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Overseas processing

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Some of the service providers used by Ang Hiyas may process or store information outside Australia. We take reasonable steps to select reputable providers that maintain appropriate privacy and security protections.


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Cookies and website analytics

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Our website may use essential cookies to support features such as customer accounts, shopping carts, security and session management.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We may also use analytics services, including Google Analytics, to understand how visitors use the website and to help improve its performance. You can restrict or disable cookies through your browser settings, although some website features may not work correctly as a result.


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Security

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We take reasonable steps to protect personal information from misuse, interference, loss, unauthorised access, modification and disclosure.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| These measures include HTTPS encryption, password hashing, restricted administrative access, secured database access and the use of established third-party payment providers. However, no internet-based system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Retention and account closure

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Personal information is retained only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our services, manage customer accounts and orders, resolve disputes and meet legal, accounting and business-record requirements.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| You may request closure of your customer account. Some order, payment and transaction records may need to be retained after account closure where required for taxation, accounting, refund, fraud-prevention or dispute-resolution purposes.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| Personal information that is no longer reasonably required may be deleted or de-identified.


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Access and correction

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| You may contact us to request access to personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct inaccurate information, or request closure of your customer account.

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We may need to confirm your identity before completing a request. In some circumstances, we may be legally required to retain particular information.


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Privacy enquiries and complaints

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| For questions, correction requests, account-closure requests or concerns about how your personal information has been handled, please contact:

							address.privacyPolicyPage__contact

								strong Ang Hiyas

								a(href='mailto:info@anghiyas.com.au') info@anghiyas.com.au

								a(href='tel:+61403542521') +61 403 542 521

								span Queensland, Australia


						section.privacyPolicyPage__section

							h2.privacyPolicyPage__subheading Changes to this policy

							p.privacyPolicyPage__text
								| We may update this Privacy Policy when our website, services, service providers or legal obligations change. The latest version will be published on this page with its updated effective date.